<title>FRANCE: Delahaye downgrades Saint-Gobain.</title>
<headline>Delahaye downgrades Saint-Gobain.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokerage Delahaye has downgraded its recommendation on Saint-Gobain to &quot;neutral&quot; from &quot;outperform&quot;, fund managers said.</p>
<p>At 1124 GMT, Saint-Gobain was down 1.85 percent at 795 francs while the CAC-40 index was up 0.36 percent at 2,591.12.</p>
</text>
